WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.875 --> 00:00:02.702
Oh, hi! I'm Ray,

2
00:00:02.762 --> 00:00:05.276
the stingray who lives inside Fabricator.

3
00:00:05.433 --> 00:00:07.411
Building a Rayfin app usually means

4
00:00:07.471 --> 00:00:11.637
juggling CLIs, Copilot, git and a browser…

5
00:00:11.697 --> 00:00:14.589
whoa. The room is spinning.

6
00:00:15.084 --> 00:00:18.051
Fabricator puts it all in one window.

7
00:00:18.333 --> 00:00:20.311
Name your app, then describe what you

8
00:00:20.371 --> 00:00:22.424
want, in plain English.

9
00:00:22.484 --> 00:00:24.847
Fabricator's agent writes the code…

10
00:00:25.314 --> 00:00:26.960
and I cheer!

11
00:00:27.367 --> 00:00:29.043
Deploy it, and I'll swim it over to

12
00:00:29.103 --> 00:00:31.843
Microsoft Fabric. Hey, that's me!

13
00:00:32.122 --> 00:00:33.428
Fins crossed.

14
00:00:33.662 --> 00:00:35.586
And Rayfin gives your app the backend it

15
00:00:35.646 --> 00:00:38.907
needs, automatically: database, APIs,

16
00:00:38.967 --> 00:00:41.624
auth, storage, functions and hosting.

17
00:00:41.684 --> 00:00:42.831
Scalable, governed,

18
00:00:42.891 --> 00:00:45.171
and inside your organization's boundary.

19
00:00:45.231 --> 00:00:46.991
You didn't lift a fin.

20
00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.025
Your app runs live,

21
00:00:49.085 --> 00:00:50.459
right next to the chat.

22
00:00:50.519 --> 00:00:51.817
See something to change?

23
00:00:51.877 --> 00:00:54.165
Point at it in Design, and ask.

24
00:00:54.700 --> 00:00:56.753
After every successful chat turn,

25
00:00:56.813 --> 00:00:58.875
Fabricator redeploys your app.

26
00:00:59.153 --> 00:01:01.583
It's live! Then share it with people in

27
00:01:01.643 --> 00:01:02.950
your organization.

28
00:01:03.200 --> 00:01:05.631
The Advisor grades your app's health.

29
00:01:05.691 --> 00:01:07.978
Blueprint maps how it all connects.

30
00:01:08.235 --> 00:01:09.464
And if something breaks,

31
00:01:09.502 --> 00:01:11.450
I'll dig through the logs with you.

32
00:01:11.800 --> 00:01:14.042
It runs on the GitHub Copilot account you

33
00:01:14.102 --> 00:01:16.268
already have. Download Fabricator,

34
00:01:16.328 --> 00:01:17.710
and come say hi!

35
00:01:18.762 --> 00:01:21.139
Psst… a group of stingrays is called a

36
00:01:21.199 --> 00:01:24.543
fever. I'm not making that up.
